flowchart LR
  NEW[New run in same concurrency group] --> CANCEL{cancel-in-progress?}
  CANCEL -->|true| OLD[Older run cancelled]
  CANCEL -->|false| KEEP[Existing run continues]
  JOB[Job starts] --> LIMIT{Finished before timeout?}
  LIMIT -->|yes| DONE[Result recorded]
  LIMIT -->|no| STOP[Terminated and marked failed]
